# ADR-15 Caddy sketch (Issue #25).
# Measurable local stack uses nginx compose (compose.admission.yaml) because
# stock Caddy needs xcaddy + rate_limit plugin for equivalent limits.
# Gate must bypass waiting room. Replace placeholders before any deploy.
#
# When product enables xcaddy rate_limit, prefer Caddyfile (sibling) over this sketch.

